abstract: >-
  C2GRAPH (Convert to Graph Engineering) is a repository-level governance
  package for long-running AI coding agents. It externalizes selected objective,
  evidence, provenance, continuity, mutation-authority, rollback/freshness,
  routing, and verification state into inspectable repository contracts.
  Version 1.3.2 extends the v1.2.0 public baseline with Workflow Convergence,
  sticky completion, durable-state-first resume revalidation, cross-plane
  terminal reconciliation, evidence-bound successor admission, globally
  consumable semantic claim identity, path/symlink hardening, and pre-append
  lock/fence revalidation while preserving the canonical repository mutation
  authority boundary and C2ModelAdapter v0.5.5.

